    <node id="越国">
      <data key="d0">越国</data>
      <data key="d1">地点</data>
      <data key="d2">The entity 越国 (the State of Yue) was a significant state during the Spring and Autumn period of ancient China, primarily known as the homeland and realm ruled by King Goujian. It was historically a principal rival and adversary of the neighboring State of Wu, engaging in prolonged conflicts marked by military and political rivalry.

越国 is notably recognized for its resurgence and eventual triumph over Wu, largely due to the strategic efforts and schemes devised by prominent figures such as Wen Zhong and Fan Li (范蠡). These advisors played critical roles in orchestrating tactics that enabled 越国 to recover and restore its strength after initial defeats.

The state was also distinguished for its exceptional tradition of swordsmithing, boasting renowned sword makers like Ou Yezi and Xue Zhu. These masters contributed to 越国’s martial culture, as the state was known for its skilled warriors and emphasis on martial training, reportedly connected with the teachings of figures such as Bai Gonggong. This martial prowess was an important facet of 越国’s identity and military capability.

Moreover, 越国 was the setting for various well-known stories and legends, particularly those involving Fan Li and his companion A Qing, emphasizing the cultural and historical significance of the state as their homeland. It served not only as a military and political entity but also as a center for artistry and warrior culture during that era.

In summary, 越国 was a prominent Spring and Autumn period state ruled by Goujian, notable for its rivalry with Wu, its revival through strategic counsel, its distinguished sword-making heritage, and its important cultural narratives centered on figures like Fan Li and A Qing. It played a crucial role in the historical and martial landscape of ancient China during its time.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-013870c1938481d1558d4c2e439c83d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42c3e318eb3b9f5e9c1bd450e13ff5b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f3e590b3ab7f94ee3770d3739196401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a72fd2ce03a23a58c65d98d2258f3e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb8a415d6907f0cafb86835c412854f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8283a4a379ab2b74495b2a64a83b7b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f89960ee186e8b69358a7a5c384a3ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f20b87683fe0cc8608a321ff18feb71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f36e0abe52b904e30fbb2a78b9a4a4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1777388235</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
